  "body": "There is an undeniable sense of sophistication about 3 Gulf View Road - an exceptional residence where timeless\r\nelegance, generous proportions and refined coastal living come together in perfect harmony.\r\n\r\nFrom the moment you arrive, the home makes an impression. Beautifully considered interiors, an abundance of\r\nnatural light and expansive living spaces, along with an executive office create an atmosphere of understated luxury. Every aspect of the residence has been designed to deliver a seamless balance between sophisticated entertaining and everyday living.\r\n\r\nFeaturing four beautifully appointed bedrooms all with ensuites, (4 bathrooms) the home offers an exceptional level of comfort,\r\nprivacy and versatility. Generous proportions and multiple living areas, provide a balance between refined\r\nentertaining and relaxed family living, while seamless indoor-outdoor connections create inviting spaces to host\r\nguests or simply enjoy the tranquillity of your surroundings.\r\n\r\nBeyond the home, an enviable coastal lifestyle awaits. Within easy reach of Murrays Bay and Mairangi Bay\r\nbeaches, boutique cafés, local restaurants and picturesque coastal walkways, this prestigious address offers the\r\nvery best of the East Coast Bays. Excellent schooling options further enhance the appeal of this highly desirable\r\nlocation.\r\n\r\nCombining an exceptional address with a residence of undeniable quality, 3 Gulf View Road presents an\r\noutstanding opportunity for discerning purchasers seeking space, sophistication and a coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nA distinguished residence. An exceptional address. A lifestyle without compromise.",
